'''Physical Aegis''' is a [[skill]] that applies a protective [[buff]] on the character and absorbs [[physical damage]] from [[hit]]s up to a certain amount before it temporarily dissipates. <br>

Amount of damage absorbed: 1000

Cooldown after depletion: 10 seconds

==Acquisition==
Physical Aegis can only be obtained by equipping {{il|The Ghastly Theatre}}.

